# 评估产物：默认不入库；但 eval-no-debate-*（本机单独跑的真实快照）与
# results/record_*（外部 LLM 评估进度）需要同步到远程，故取消忽略。
# 其余 eval-* 是 Junction 链接（指向 artifacts/evaluation/ 的 Docker 产物），保持忽略。
backend/tests/evaluation/artifacts/*
!backend/tests/evaluation/artifacts/eval-no-debate-*/
backend/tests/evaluation/doc/reference/*
backend/tests/evaluation/LLM/config/external_llm.yaml
backend/tests/evaluation/results/*
!backend/tests/evaluation/results/**
backend/tests/evaluation/export_data.sql
backend/tests/evaluation/results/reports/*
backend/tests/evaluation/clean_export_sql.py